profile.POTATO.comment=Potato default preset for maximum FPS. Features high-FPS procedural water waves, ambient SSS, sky wind ribbons, waving plants, torchlight, and wrapped diffuse lighting — zero shadow map & ray pass overhead!
profile.FAST.comment=Fast preset for smooth performance. Features 1-tap fast shadow maps, 3-octave foam & refraction water, sky wind ribbons, and waving plants!
profile.FANCY.comment=Fancy preset. Full water quality, procedural waves, sun specular, and high-detail clouds.
profile.FABULOUS.comment=Fabulous preset. Maximum visual quality with TAA, SMAA, SSAO, and full reflections.
